# November 19, 2026: Cayuga County, New York: Auburn and its edge (Owasco, Fleming, Montezuma), the east shore of Cayuga
# Lake (Aurora, Sherwood, Poplar Ridge, Union Springs) and the Owasco valley south (Moravia, Genoa, New Hope), with one
# trolley substation just over the line in Skaneateles. Region drawn at random by tools/choose.py --state ny (cny,
# which offered Moravia); the Atlas had nothing within 20 km of Moravia and only canal places north of Auburn.
# Sources read in this session: Wikipedia through tools/wiki_raw.py (the Cayuga County Register list with --rows),
# HMdb nearby lists and marker pages through tools/page.py, the managing bodies' own pages (sewardhouse.org, nps.gov/hart,
# cayugamuseum.org, howlandstonestore.org, parks.ny.gov), TourCayuga listings read through the site's wp-json copy,
# the William G. Pomeroy Foundation's Mentz Church page, a WAMC report on the Wells College sale, and a Waymarking page
# quoting St. Matthew's own description. Interiors were not visited by any source opened unless the entry says so.
